    <string name="faq_connect_partner_q">How to connect a partner?</string>
    <string name="faq_connect_partner_a">1. Go to Profile -> Share Code.\n2. Send the code to your partner.\n3. Your partner taps "Invite" on the Home screen and enters your code.</string>

    <string name="faq_love_tree_q">How does the Love Tree work?</string>
    <string name="faq_love_tree_a">The tree grows as you use the app. You earn points for daily login (+10) and for uploading photos (+5). There are 10 growth stages in total!</string>

    <string name="faq_add_widget_q">How to add a Widget?</string>
    <string name="faq_add_widget_a">Long press on an empty space on your home screen -> Widgets -> Find Our Memories -> Drag the widget to the screen. It updates automatically.</string>

    <string name="faq_photos_loading_q">Photos not loading?</string>
    <string name="faq_photos_loading_a">Check your internet connection. If you use Xiaomi/Poco, make sure the app has network access and Autostart enabled in phone settings.</string>

    <string name="faq_widget_bug_q">Why isn\'t the widget updating?</string>
    <string name="faq_widget_bug_a">If you have Xiaomi (MIUI), Huawei, or Samsung:\n\n1. Open Phone Settings -> Apps -> Our Memories.\n2. Enable "Autostart".\n3. In "Battery Saver" or "Activity Control", select "No restrictions".\n\nThe system saves battery and might stop widget updates.</string>

    <string name="faq_earn_points_q">How to earn Tree points?</string>
    <string name="faq_earn_points_a">The tree grows from your love!\n\n☀️ Daily login: +10 points\n📸 Upload photo: +5 points per photo\n\nThere are 10 stages of tree evolution.</string>

    <string name="faq_wishes_q">How to manage wishes?</string>
    <string name="faq_wishes_a">👉 Tap a wish to mark it as done.\n🛑 Long press to delete it.</string>

    <string name="faq_change_cover_q">How to change the album cover?</string>
    <string name="faq_change_cover_a">Open any album. Press and hold on the photo you like. Select "Make Cover" from the menu.</string>

    <string name="faq_fridge_q">What is the "Fridge Note"?</string>
    <string name="faq_fridge_a">This is a shared text field. Text you write there appears immediately on your partner\'s screen. Perfect for "Good morning!" or "Buy milk".</string>

    <string name="faq_privacy_q">Can anyone see our photos?</string>
    <string name="faq_privacy_a">No. Your memories, lists, and chats are available only to the two of you. We use a secure connection to sync data.</string>


